      "id": "claim_f2d359a7d295479f83c673060fdc3431",
      "statement": "The agent chain was proven end to end in production (subject token minted by the BFF → RFC 8693 token exchange → `movie-mcp` → `mc-service`); before the client secrets were corrected the gateway silently fell back to TMDB-only because a failed exchange yielded no subject token, which short-circuited every `needs_token` tool.",
