      "id": "claim_2f1958d0be84486389d95041c339abfd",
      "statement": "The `deploy=true` CD leg validates itself with a post-deploy health probe that requires both the realm-qualified OIDC issuer (`https://auth.<base>/realms/grumpyrobot`) and an HTTP 200 from the app, polling for convergence; comparing against a bare auth host fails on a perfectly healthy realm.",
