      "statement": "A Keycloak confidential client whose secret is not pinned in the realm JSON gets a freshly generated random secret on every realm import, so the consuming Komodo Variable must be copied from the post-import Keycloak console; a stale or placeholder value fails the token exchange with HTTP 401 invalid_client, which presents like a missing-configuration problem rather than a wrong secret.",
      "evidence": [
